[E0342] Error: `Point` cannot be written in a hole of `Html`: it does not implement `Text`
    ╭─[ err/676_what_a_template_refuses/main.wip:28:22 ]
    │
 28 │     val c: Html = "<p>\(Point(x: 1))</p>"
    │                         ─────┬─────
    │                              ╰─────── not `Text`
    │
    │ Help: write `extend Point: Text`
    │
    │ Note: a hole's value is given to the `pushValue` of `Html`, which takes a `Text`
